 "text": "Hey, good to have you back. How are you? Pretty exciting. Which kind of e bike is he after? Makes sense. Most e bikes lower the handlebars by about an inch, so he' probably ride at the same level as before. No problem. What's on your mind? That's totally normal. The main question is whether he wants an e bike for short trips or long ones, and how he's feeling on small rides. Then short trips first are great. An e bike will get you somewhere without making him feel like he's on holiday.",
